         <component>
            <section ID="i4i_specific_populations_id_f7dcc429-69ff-421c-8735-af436b412365">
               <id root="2d755c57-8a4a-4eb3-bf19-cf8bb44a1507"/>
               <code code="43684-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="USE IN SPECIFIC POPULATIONS SECTION"/>
               <title>8 USE IN SPECIFIC POPULATIONS</title>
               <effectiveTime value="20170719"/>
               <excerpt>
                  <highlight>
                     <text>
                        <list listType="unordered">
                           <item>
                              <caption>•</caption>Caution should be exercised when isosulfan blue injection 1% is administered to nursing mothers (<linkHtml href="#i4i_nursing_mothers_id_90facf94-7adb-4994-877c-3f13686a87ea">8.3</linkHtml>).</item>
                           <item>
                              <caption>•</caption>Safety and effectiveness of isosulfan blue injection 1% in children has not been established (<linkHtml href="#i4i_pediatric_use_id_44fdb2b2-bf1e-425a-8d7e-1cc8d881cac5">8.4</linkHtml>).</item>
                        </list>
                     </text>
                  </highlight>
               </excerpt>
               <component>
                  <section ID="i4i_nursing_mothers_id_90facf94-7adb-4994-877c-3f13686a87ea">
                     <id root="33cec209-4a10-41be-b9f8-be74150071d5"/>
                     <code code="34080-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="NURSING MOTHERS SECTION"/>
                     <title>8.3 Nursing Mothers</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>It is not known whether this drug is excreted in human milk.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>Because many drugs are excreted in human milk, caution should be exercised when isosulfan blue injection 1% is administered to a nursing mother.</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20170719"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
               <component>
                  <section ID="i4i_pediatric_use_id_44fdb2b2-bf1e-425a-8d7e-1cc8d881cac5">
                     <id root="9c5c1955-94e6-4943-9abe-0e0cd85b34c8"/>
                     <code code="34081-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="PEDIATRIC USE SECTION"/>
                     <title>8.4 Pediatric Use</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Safety and effectiveness of isosulfan blue injection 1% in children have not been established.</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20170719"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
            </section>
